accompanying LICENSE file. The BSD 3-Clause attribution above is retained for
the Decky Plugin Template; the GPL terms govern this project as a whole.

Mini achievements restoration
-----------------------------
src/steam/miniAchievements.ts adapts the native achievement-bar restoration
from Decky UI Restored by beallio (the Decky-SteamAchievements source checkout).
The source project and Decky Metadata are distributed under the
GNU General Public License v3.0 or later.

    Decky UI Restored
    https://github.com/beallio/Decky-UI-Restored

ProtonDB badge integration
--------------------------
The native footer hosts, React portal cover renderer, and Steam/Algolia title
lookup in src/protondb/covers.tsx, steamSearch.ts, and matchTitle.ts are adapted
from the local beallio fork of ProtonDB Badges by bschelst. The fork's cover
layout and icon geometry are retained. Ratings and medal colors come from
ProtonDB's direct summaries, not the separate compatibility analysis service.
The Store-page integration approach is also based on ProtonDB Badges.

